{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22396","headline":"沐浴 · 白居易","name":"沐浴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"经年不沐浴，尘垢满肌肤。\n今朝一澡濯，衰瘦颇有余。\n老色头鬓白，病形支体虚。\n衣宽有賸带，发少不胜梳。\n自问今年岁，春秋四十初。\n四十已如此，七十复何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}